# Production only: connect the terminal WebSocket straight to the API host
# (Vercel cannot proxy WebSockets). Authenticated with a single-use ticket from
# POST /api/sandbox/shell-ticket. No trailing slash, no path.
# VITE_* is baked in at build time: set it in the Vercel build env and redeploy.
# The API's WebSocket Origin check requires PUBLIC_ORIGIN to equal the Vercel web origin.
# Leave unset in development: the Vite dev proxy handles the same-origin socket.
# VITE_SHELL_WS_ORIGIN=wss://learnquest-api.onrender.com
